WEBVTT

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:37.200
You're not staying over?

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:41.360
Um, I...

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:43.560
Um...

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:52.500
It's all right.

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:57.360
I'm not hungry like the wolf.

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:59.100
I can sleep on the floor.

00:01:59.570 --> 00:02:02.160
I won't do anything you don't want me to.

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:07.820
It's up to you whether or not you believe me, though.

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:10.480
I, uh...

00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:12.800
What's that face for?

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:22.240
Oh, come on. You don't have to look so frantic.

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:26.960
Sorry.

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:31.010
I'll walk you home.

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:41.530
There's a rumor that he goes out with girls like it's a game.

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:44.230
I figured it was about time you two broke up.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:50.530
Until now, Ikkyu has always broken up with his girlfriend after three months, for some reason.

00:02:50.530 --> 00:02:52.290
One more month...

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:55.690
<i>Is that...</i>

00:02:58.390 --> 00:03:00.050
<i>This text again?</i>

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:04.620
<i>What do they mean, "daily report"?</i>

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:28.890
Good morning.

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:30.450
Did something happen?

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:36.360
Why do girls never hesitate to try to steal me

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:38.990
even when they know that I have a girlfriend?

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:43.740
They say things like, "I'm more fun," in a half joking way.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:50.950
Sometimes I think that I might really hate girls.

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:53.040
Ikki?

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.250
It's nothing.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:58.220
I was just saying that I don't understand how girls think.

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:00.590
Including you.

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:03.470
It's almost time to open.

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:10.170
Um...

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:10.770
What is it?

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:13.360
My daily report...

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:14.620
Daily report?

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:15.690
What are you talking about?

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:18.300
I-I'm sorry. It's nothing.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:20.280
You look half asleep.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.570
Do you want to do some basic training before we open?

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:24.620
N-No.

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:28.150
Mine returned to the front line yesterday,

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:30.370
but due to poor health, she couldn't come in today.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:34.010
So today, you two will have to pick up the slack.

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:35.300
I'm counting on you!

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:36.020
Yes, sir!

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:36.890
Yes, sir.

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:37.830
Waka—

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:38.460
Stop.
Waka—

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:41.300
I sympathize on a personal level.

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:44.100
Sorry.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:58.110
Sometimes I think that I might really hate girls.

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:02.150
<i>Which is the real Ikki?</i>

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:09.120
Hey, good evening.

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:12.720
Nice to meet you.

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:13.570
Or is it,

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:15.130
nice to see you again?

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:16.090
You're...

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:19.520
You're going out with Ikki now, right?

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:24.040
Then let me warn you.

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:26.640
Be careful not to make any enemies.

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:32.270
Sorry for holding you up. See you.

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:52.700
Ow...

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:02.110
Yes?

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:02.980
What happened?

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:05.780
What's this about being out sick?

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:08.460
I haven't felt well all day...

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:10.540
Are you okay?

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:13.070
I have a headache.

00:06:13.070 --> 00:06:14.020
I'm heading over.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:22.490
It's me.

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:24.520
I couldn't just sit around.

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:25.990
Ikki?

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:28.790
I brought you some medicine and stuff.

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:31.740
Um, what was...

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:33.240
Oh, that?

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:34.310
It's a disguise.

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:37.330
I didn't want to be bothered by any girls.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:40.500
I made completely sure no one would approach me.

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:43.560
Are you okay?

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:48.770
It doesn't seem bad, but you're pretty hot, so let's take your temperature.

00:06:50.690 --> 00:06:53.930
I'm glad you're looking better than I expected.

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:55.220
Yeah.

00:06:57.500 --> 00:07:01.050
You haven't eaten all day, right?

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:03.010
I'll make you something.

00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:04.650
What would you like?

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:08.880
You can be as demanding or as selfish as you want.

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:10.620
Thank you very much.

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:16.120
If you happen to fall in love with me along the way, I'd be even happier.

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:24.990
<i>Good morning.</i>

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:27.510
<i>I hope your fever is down this morning.</i>

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:29.930
<i>I left breakfast in the fridge.</i>

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:31.560
<i>Try eating if you can.</i>

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:34.350
We'll now begin the morning assembly.

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:35.610
First,

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:40.810
for the girl who caught a fever despite my constant warnings to take care of herself,

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:42.820
I'll have you go through very thorough training.

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:45.030
Yes, sir.

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:48.940
Hey, are you feeling better?

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:51.330
Yeah, sorry for troubling you.

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:54.320
It's fine. I didn't do anything.

00:07:56.980 --> 00:08:00.970
Just as I told you I would, I confessed to Ikki,

00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:02.500
but I was rejected of course.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:06.290
He said, "You know I have a girlfriend."

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:11.960
Ikki's a lot more serious than I thought.

00:08:13.140 --> 00:08:15.620
I'm over it now.

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:17.320
I just wanted to tell you.

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:22.290
And that's why I'll be absent from the trip to Shinano.

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:23.840
Trip?

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:26.980
The joint trip with the Billiard Association.

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:30.030
If your cold gets better, you can go too.

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:32.110
Y-Yeah.

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:34.330
I hope some hot guys come.

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:38.950
<i>Shinano? Again?</i>

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:43.880
Ikki's college's club is just a bunch of fan girls, isn't it?

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:47.480
And the organizer this time is the fan club president.

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:48.700
That's right.

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:51.260
You should prepare yourself.

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:52.810
Yeah.

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:55.900
You know...

00:08:56.920 --> 00:08:58.500
Sorry about before.

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:00.160
For being so nosy, I mean.

00:09:01.360 --> 00:09:03.730
About you and Ikki.

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:08.060
No, I don't blame you.

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:12.810
You hated him so much that you used to say you were working with the worst person ever.

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:15.280
And then you joined the fan club all of a sudden.

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:17.450
I joined the fan club?

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:19.870
You said there was something you wanted to find out,

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:24.000
but when I heard you were going out, I was really surprised.

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:30.930
I was just apologizing for being nosy, and here I am doing it again.

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:32.110
I'm really sorry.

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:35.220
But seriously, if anything happens, you can talk to me.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.560
Okay. Thanks.

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:39.780
Bye then.

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:40.580
Bye.

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:46.750
I was in the fan club?

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:51.280
You broke your promise, didn't you?

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:53.540
What could that mean?

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:57.930
Yes?

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:00.130
How are you feeling?

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:01.520
Are you all better?

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:03.740
Yeah.

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:06.620
Hey, say something.

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:11.440
I might die if I don't hear your voice, you know.

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:14.400
Have you been drinking?

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:17.150
Yep. But I'm fine.

00:10:17.150 --> 00:10:20.350
I love talking to other people when I'm drunk.

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:26.330
Didn't I call you like this once before?

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:29.410
I really drove you up the wall.

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:37.270
Just talk about something.

00:10:38.230 --> 00:10:39.650
Anything.

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:41.590
I want to hear your voice.

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:43.290
Are you all right?

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:44.780
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:48.190
I was able to walk all the way here by myself.

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:50.410
Here?

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:55.010
Ikki!

00:10:57.730 --> 00:10:58.890
Ikki...

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:02.600
I'm like a stalker.

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:04.980
Sorry.

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:09.110
Wait. Just listen from there.

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:14.760
There's always been something heavy in my heart that's made me suffer.

00:11:15.890 --> 00:11:22.310
But when I hear your voice or see your face, that something starts to melt.

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:23.450
I'm calm.

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:28.250
A girl confessed her love for me again today.

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:30.200
And I rejected her and made her cry.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:33.860
But seeing that...

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:37.250
didn't make me feel guilt or pity.

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:40.950
Just heavy.

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:47.810
I thought, "I want this to be over. I want to see <i>you</i>."

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:49.900
It's terrible, right?

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:52.970
But I know that as long as I have these eyes,

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:55.640
I'll never be able to escape this burden.

00:11:57.590 --> 00:12:02.010
That's why I chose to forgo serious relationships and just have fun with girls.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:05.630
In the end, that didn't go well either.

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:08.620
But you're different.

00:12:08.980 --> 00:12:11.500
You're the only one who's different.

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:14.000
How am I different?

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:17.780
Because they don't affect you at all,

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:19.600
the one I want to affect the most.

00:12:20.350 --> 00:12:22.270
They don't work on you.

00:12:22.270 --> 00:12:24.000
That's why you're special.

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:28.710
Thanks for listening to me.

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:31.890
I'm really glad I got to talk to you.

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.400
No, it's...

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:36.690
It's getting cold.

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:39.610
You don't want your cold to come back.

00:12:40.290 --> 00:12:42.030
You should go back into your room.

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:44.230
I'll go now.

00:12:44.230 --> 00:12:45.360
Good night.

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:48.470
Good night!

00:13:13.110 --> 00:13:14.690
Only three guys?

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:17.630
And one's Ikki.

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:19.300
The female ratio is huge!

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:21.560
We're all here.

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:25.160
Rika, if you would.

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:28.620
Good morning, everyone.

00:13:29.270 --> 00:13:31.720
Myoga University, Seichi University,

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:36.380
welcome to the Billiard Association's joint trip.

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:40.150
I organized this trip.

00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:42.110
It's wonderful to meet you.

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:50.780
<i>Here I am again...</i>

00:13:56.340 --> 00:13:57.130
All right.

00:13:57.130 --> 00:13:58.250
Wow, Ikki!

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:00.140
You're too cool!

00:14:00.140 --> 00:14:03.490
I'd rather watch Ikki than play billiards.

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:05.590
Yes, yes, thank you.

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:07.390
But keep it down.

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:08.530
I'll miss my shot.

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:10.790
You'll be fine, right, Ikki?

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:13.620
Show me how to shoot later.

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:14.600
Cut it out.

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:19.730
You don't care about that, right?

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:25.430
Why would you need to worry about her if I'm only teaching you billiards?

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:26.920
Right?

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:33.180
"Watch me"?

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:39.310
Wow!

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:40.860
You're amazing!

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:51.120
Ikki.

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:53.100
What about everyone else?

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:54.620
I'm having them play a game.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:59.700
Whoever sinks the seven-ball will earn a chance to have tea with Ikki in the lounge!

00:15:01.030 --> 00:15:02.550
Do you have a moment?

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:05.260
Yeah.

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:13.180
Look at all the stars.

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:13.930
Yes.

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:16.810
A shooting star.

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:18.650
Did you make a wish?

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:23.940
I once wished upon a shooting star.

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:26.820
When I was little,

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:30.770
I gazed up at the sky like this and wished upon a shooting star,

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:33.600
"I want to be popular with girls."

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:37.410
What a helpless kid, right?

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:40.680
Sometimes I think, wasn't there something else I could've wished for?

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:47.170
But after that, the attitudes of the girls around me changed.

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:51.870
Just by having our eyes meet, they'd all be so nice to me.

00:15:52.670 --> 00:15:54.380
I was surprised at first.

00:15:55.940 --> 00:16:00.370
But the older I got, the more I understood the girls' reactions.

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:02.400
By middle school I realized

00:16:03.180 --> 00:16:04.860
that my wish had come true.

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:10.140
I wonder if it's a punishment for making such a stupid wish.

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:12.990
I could never feel close to anyone after that.

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:16.730
Even when I date a girl, for some reason,

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:18.750
she'll leave me after three months.

00:16:19.110 --> 00:16:20.770
<i>The girl leaves </i>him<i>?</i>

00:16:21.510 --> 00:16:24.410
I'm always surrounded by girls,

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:26.900
and they are always mean to her,

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:29.140
so she probably gets tired of it.

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:31.260
The cycle never ends.

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:32.810
If we're going to break up eventually, I thought,

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:37.720
why not just make three months the limit and just date for fun?

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:44.560
I thought I could never really fall in love anymore and had given up.

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:48.910
Until I met you.

00:16:50.260 --> 00:16:55.030
It's true that in the beginning, I took interest in you because my eyes didn't affect you.

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:57.090
But now it's different.

00:16:57.090 --> 00:17:03.340
I'm always thinking about how I can show you my true feelings,

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:06.770
but I can't seem to find the words.

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:11.320
You probably don't even believe me.

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:11.970
No.

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:17.260
I was wrong about you, Ikki.

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:19.690
Of course you were.

00:17:19.690 --> 00:17:21.810
That's just how I've always acted.

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:25.480
But I want you to know this at least.

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:31.510
I want you to always be by my side.

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:34.950
I love you.

00:17:53.490 --> 00:17:55.310
Look, a shooting star.

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:58.180
I wish that you'll fall in love with me.

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:01.930
That you won't be mad that I selfishly kissed you.

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:05.720
That you might let me do it again.

00:18:06.540 --> 00:18:08.130
I might be asking too much.

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:11.740
Let's go back.

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:19.590
<i>If it's the girls who leave Ikki,</i>

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:22.760
<i>why is it always three months?</i>

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:26.830
You have a second?

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:32.360
Rika...

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:37.080
I'm sorry for calling you out here.

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:37.900
It's fine.

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:41.280
Have you forgotten?

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:46.140
I told you when you were initiated.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:50.270
I wouldn't allow you to monopolize Ikki.

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:52.690
What happened to that promise?

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:54.830
Um, promise?

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:56.150
Don't play dumb.

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:59.570
The time you spend with Ikki isn't just your own!

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:02.070
We all share it, right?!

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:04.810
What are you talking about?

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:05.540
Oh?

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:07.900
Didn't we ask for it?

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:08.960
The daily report.

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:17.120
To record in detail what you did with Ikki and submit it every day.

00:19:18.360 --> 00:19:22.470
That was the agreement for allowing you to go out with Ikki.

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:27.480
You must accept the consequences of forgetting your duty.

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:29.530
<i>These girls...</i>

00:19:29.530 --> 00:19:31.650
Be careful from now on.

00:19:32.220 --> 00:19:37.160
Please submit your reports from August 1st until now as soon as you get back.

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:40.460
Take care.

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:47.630
You'd better keep your promise.

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:51.530
We each get to be with Ikki for only three months.

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:52.790
You know that, right?

00:19:53.430 --> 00:19:58.760
I don't understand why Ikki would want to go out with a plain-looking girl like you in the first place.

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:01.550
Your three months are almost up anyway.

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:05.520
But if you can't keep your promise, then we'll have you break up immediately!

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:06.810
For Ikki's sake as well.

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:10.600
Uh... Don't you think that's wrong?

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:11.860
Are you talking back to us?!

00:20:11.860 --> 00:20:13.360
Don't get full of yourself!

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:18.390
Cool your head for a bit.

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:28.960
They're terrible!

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:30.270
Way too violent.

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:31.820
Orion! You're back?

00:20:31.820 --> 00:20:32.580
Yep.

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:34.590
I'm glad.

00:20:34.590 --> 00:20:37.230
But who were those girls?

00:20:37.230 --> 00:20:39.340
Aren't they the girls who bullied you before?

00:20:39.820 --> 00:20:42.860
They were saying something about three months with Ikki each?

00:20:44.310 --> 00:20:48.260
They're from Ikki's fan club.

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:54.040
It looks like they had agreed not to date Ikki for more than three months.

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:58.170
Probably so that no one can have him forever and everyone gets a turn.

00:20:58.170 --> 00:21:00.100
What?!

00:21:00.100 --> 00:21:03.140
I was wrong about Ikki.

00:21:03.140 --> 00:21:06.040
I guess it's tough being popular.

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:09.210
But it seems like he really does care about you,

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:11.170
and I'm glad you cleared up the misunderstanding.

00:21:11.170 --> 00:21:11.850
Yeah.

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:17.380
What? Water?

00:21:17.910 --> 00:21:19.380
Oh no! What should we do?

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:21.840
It's going to sink!

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:40.940
Hey, you!

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:42.820
Hang in there!

00:21:43.270 --> 00:21:44.490
Swim!

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:46.240
Damn.

00:21:47.020 --> 00:21:48.630
Why can't I grab her?!

00:23:25.790 --> 00:23:29.520
If you were told you had only one wish, what would you wish for?

00:23:29.520 --> 00:23:33.970
I'd wish for your memories to return safely.

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:36.640
And also that you wouldn't get into any trouble.

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:39.490
But I guess that's two wishes...
